From 0a7bb5403d0290cea8b2356179d92e4c61ffd51d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Julien Olivain <ju.o@free.fr>
Date: Wed, 15 Mar 2023 20:24:38 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fesvr: fix compilation with gcc 13

Upstream: https://github.com/riscv-software-src/riscv-isa-sim/commit/0a7bb5403d0290cea8b2356179d92e4c61ffd51d
Backport-to: Spike v1.1.0

Explicitly include the fixed-width integer header after GCC's transitive
header dependencies changed. This is the upstream one-line fix, retained
with its author credit for the pinned release build.

Signed-off-by: Julien Olivain <ju.o@free.fr>
---
diff --git a/fesvr/device.h b/fesvr/device.h
--- a/fesvr/device.h
+++ b/fesvr/device.h
@@ -6,6 +6,7 @@
 #include <cstring>
 #include <string>
 #include <functional>
+#include <cstdint>
 
 class memif_t;
 
